{"seq":1,"slug":"checkout-tax-landed-cost-model","title":"结算页税额与落地价（landed cost）呈现模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/checkout-collection-invoice-record/checkout-tax-landed-cost-model","wordCount":3149,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"结算页税额与落地价-landed-cost-呈现模型\">结算页税额与落地价（landed cost）呈现模型</h1><p>一件标价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>59</mn><mtext>的耳机的</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&quot;</mi><mtext>到手价</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&quot;</mi><mtext>取决于它经过哪条链路：从美国仓发往洛杉矶是</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">59 的耳机的&quot;到手价&quot;取决于它经过哪条链路：从美国仓发往洛杉矶是</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">59</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的耳机的</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">到手价</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">取决于它经过哪条链路：从美国仓发往洛杉矶是</span></span></span></span></span>59 加约 9.5% 的州与地方销售税；从深圳直发柏林，若走 IOSS，是 €59 加 19% 德国 VAT，若不走，则变成 €59 加进口 VAT 再加关税、报关费与承运方清关手续费。结算页要在链路的哪个时点、用哪套数据结构、以什么精度把税额与落地价讲清楚，是跨境收单最容易被低估的工程问题。</p>\n<p>本文定义落地价的组成公式、三类呈现时机的取舍、从&quot;送达地地址&quot;解析到税额的完整流水线，以及呈现模型必须向客户端承诺的数据契约。它承接本 hub 的制度底座（见 <a href=\"../indirect-tax-regime-registration-model/ioss-oss-vat-regime-matrix\"><code>1_indirect-tax-regime-registration-model/1_ioss-oss-vat-regime-matrix.md</code></a>）与判定引擎（见 <a href=\"../tax-determination-engine/economic-nexus-connection-modeling\"><code>2_tax-determination-engine/1_economic-nexus-connection-modeling.md</code></a>），落到&quot;结算页这一刻该显示什么&quot;。前置是制度层的 IOSS/OSS 门槛与视同供应商规则、判定层的目的地课税触发条件、海关层的成交价格估价。三组核心术语先在此定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>落地价（landed cost）</strong>：消费者为收到货物实际付出的金额，含货价、运费、保险、关税、间接税与清关手续费。</li>\n<li><strong>内在价值</strong>：货价本身，<strong>不含</strong>单独列示的运费、保险与税费——各类制度门槛的判定基准。</li>\n<li><strong>税基（tax base）</strong>：某一税种据以计征的金额，进口 VAT 税基含关税而门槛判定用内在价值，两者不同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-落地价的组成与税基\">核心概念：落地价的组成与税基</h2><p>落地成本（landed cost）的通行定义是&quot;取得货物的真实成本&quot;，即基础货价加上制造商与零售商之间产生的一切费用：运费、保险费、进口关税与其他费用（维基百科 Landed cost 词条）。换算成结算页可逐项列示的字段：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = P + F + I + D + T + B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是商品价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是运费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是保险费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是关税（duty），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是间接税（VAT / GST / 州销售税），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是清关与代垫手续费。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 不是同一类：<strong>关税按税则征收，税基与税率由商品归类（HS 编码）与原产地决定；间接税按目的地规则征收，税基公式不同。</strong></p>\n<p>关税的税基是海关估价。世界贸易组织《海关估价协定》（WTO Customs Valuation Agreement）确立了六种按先后顺序适用的估价方法，首选是<strong>成交价格法</strong>：以&quot;货物出口到进口国时实际支付或应付的价格&quot;为海关价值（Article 1）。因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>成交价格（按 Article 8 调整）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = c \\cdot r_{HS}, \\qquad c = \\text{成交价格（按 Article 8 调整）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成交价格（按</span><span class=\"mord\"> Article 8 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">调整）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而进口环节间接税的税基通常<strong>包含关税</strong>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>import</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{import}} = (c + F + I + D) \\cdot r_{VAT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">import</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这正是&quot;到手价&quot;高于&quot;标价 × (1+税率)&quot;的原因——税上加税（关税计入 VAT 税基），而很多结算页的估价模型漏掉了这层叠加，导致到货时出现预期之外的手续费。英国内陆税收署（GOV.UK）对&quot;内在价值（intrinsic value）&quot;的定义同样要求把<strong>单独列示的运费、保险与其他可识别税费排除在税基之外</strong>——门槛判定用内在价值，进口 VAT 税基用含运费的到岸价，两套税基不能混用同一字段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成项</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>税基归属</th>\n<th>决定因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>内在价值 / 成交价格</td>\n<td>卖家定价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费、保险</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F, I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>计入进口 VAT 税基；不计入门槛内在价值</td>\n<td>物流方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关税</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>进口 VAT 税基的一部分</td>\n<td>HS 编码 × 原产地 × 成交价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间接税</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>目的地规则</td>\n<td>送达地税率 × 税基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关手续费</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不课税</td>\n<td>承运方 / 报关行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三类呈现时机-估价-ddp-预付与派送时征收\">三类呈现时机：估价、DDP 预付与派送时征收</h2><p>结算页&quot;显示税额&quot;不是一件事，而是三种互斥的商业承诺，工程实现与风险归属完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>结账即收（DDP，Delivered Duty Paid）</strong>：卖家或平台在结账时向消费者收取含税含费的完整落地价，并承担进口清关与缴税义务。Incoterms 2020 的 DDP 规则规定卖方&quot;负责进口清关、取得必要授权，并支付把货物运抵目的地的一切费用，包括进口关税与税费&quot;，且不负责卸货（国际商会 Incoterms 2020）。消费者看到的金额就是终价，没有后续补缴——这是&quot;no surprise fees&quot;体验的唯一实现方式，但把关税预测误差的风险转移给了卖家。</p>\n<p><strong>结账估价、派送时征收（DAP / 旧称 DDU）</strong>：结算页只显示估价，进口税与手续费由消费者在派送前向承运方补缴。DAP 规则下买方负责进口清关、进口关税、税费与卸货，风险在货物&quot;在指定目的地置于买方处置之下&quot;时转移；DDU 已不在 Incoterms 2020 之列，仅在旧合同中可见。这条路对卖家最省事，却是&quot;意外关税&quot;投诉的根源——结算页必须显式声明税费将在派送时收取，否则算作误导。</p>\n<p><strong>欧盟 IOSS 路线</strong>：自 2021 年 7 月 1 日起，单件内在价值不超过 €150 的进口货物可由卖家在结账时收取目的地国 VAT，并通过进口一站式申报（IOSS）集中申报，消费者在派送时不再被二次征收（维基百科 Import One Stop Shop）。平台作为&quot;视同供应商（deemed supplier）&quot;承担该 VAT 义务；非欧盟企业<strong>必须委任一名欧盟境内中介</strong>并取得 IOSS 识别号。三类时机的工程分水岭是<strong>风险归属</strong>：DDP 与 IOSS 把关税预测误差的风险留在卖家侧，DAP 推给买家——同一条链路可能因存货地不同落进不同分支，呈现模型须按订单实际发货计划而非商品静态属性来选分支。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[消费者进入结算页] --&gt; B{货物存货地 / 发货地}&#10;  B --&gt;|欧盟境内仓| C[OSS 目的地课税&lt;br/&gt;结账即收含税价]&#10;  B --&gt;|第三国直发, 内在价值 ≤ EUR 150| D{发货方注册 IOSS?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[DDP 结账即收&lt;br/&gt;IOSS 号随货件流转]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[派送时由承运方代征&lt;br/&gt;结算页显示估价]&#10;  B --&gt;|第三国直发, 价值 &gt; EUR 150| G[进口 VAT + 关税&lt;br/&gt;结账页须显式告知补缴]&#10;  C --&gt; H[落地价即终价]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; I[落地价为估价&lt;br/&gt;须标注派送时收取]&#10;  G --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[消费者进入结算页] --&gt; B{货物存货地 / 发货地}\n  B --&gt;|欧盟境内仓| C[OSS 目的地课税&lt;br/&gt;结账即收含税价]\n  B --&gt;|第三国直发, 内在价值 ≤ EUR 150| D{发货方注册 IOSS?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[DDP 结账即收&lt;br/&gt;IOSS 号随货件流转]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[派送时由承运方代征&lt;br/&gt;结算页显示估价]\n  B --&gt;|第三国直发, 价值 &gt; EUR 150| G[进口 VAT + 关税&lt;br/&gt;结账页须显式告知补缴]\n  C --&gt; H[落地价即终价]\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; I[落地价为估价&lt;br/&gt;须标注派送时收取]\n  G --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"税率解析-从送达地地址到税率栈\">税率解析：从送达地地址到税率栈</h2><p>呈现税额的精度上限由税率解析精度决定。呈现模型拿到的不是&quot;一个税率&quot;，而是一条从地址到税率栈的解析链。</p>\n<p><strong>美国</strong>没有联邦 VAT，销售税由州、县、市、特别区逐级叠加。以芝加哥为例，10.25% 的一般税率由 6.25% 州税 + 1.25% 市税 + 1.75% 县税 + 1% 区域交通局税构成，餐饮再加 1% 会展局税达 11.25%（维基百科 Sales tax）。合并税率是加法的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>combined</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{combined}} = r_{state} + r_{county} + r_{city} + r_{district}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">combined</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在于<strong>来源地（origin）与目的地（destination）两种课税基准</strong>：多数州对远程销售采用目的地基准，税率跟随消费者收货地址而非卖家所在地；佛罗里达的县附加税明确规定&quot;若为配送则按目的县税率征收&quot;（维基百科 Sales taxes in the United States 词条）。工程后果是：结算页必须用<strong>收货地址</strong>（而非账单地址或账户默认地址）解析税率，地址一旦变更就要重新解析并刷新落地价；special district 层只能按街道级地址匹配，用 ZIP 级近似表会产生系统性偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>欧盟</strong>按消费者所在成员国的 VAT 税率课征，各国标准税率与减免品类不同，结算页不能假设&quot;欧盟 = 某单一税率&quot;，必须落到具体成员国。<strong>英国</strong>采用 £135 门槛：整批托运货值不超过 £135 时，卖方须在销售时点计征 VAT；超过则回归正常进口 VAT 与关税（GOV.UK）。门槛按<strong>整批托运</strong>而非单件计算，这把&quot;购物车多件小商品&quot;的合并计税逻辑推到了结算页：呈现模型须按托运批次而非按行项目计算门槛。<strong>制度选择本身是带状态的</strong>——欧盟 OSS 的 €10,000 门槛一旦越过即转为目的地课税、且锁定两个日历年，所以结算页读到的税率还取决于账户级累计状态，呈现层须连同&quot;依据哪套制度&quot;的元数据一起缓存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精度-舍入与货币-可见数字背后的硬约束\">精度、舍入与货币：可见数字背后的硬约束</h2><p>三条硬约束决定呈现模型的可实现边界。第一，<strong>税额必须在最小货币单位上闭合</strong>：呈现的税额与税基、税率之间不能有分位偏差，否则发票与申报数据对不上。税额按最小单位（分 / cent）四舍五入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>shown</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">round</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{shown}} = \\operatorname{round}\\!\\left(b \\cdot r,\\ \\tfrac{1}{100}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shown</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>多条行项目分别舍入后求和 vs 先求和再舍入，结果可能差几分钱。<strong>结算页的呈现口径必须与开票和申报口径一致</strong>——先按适用税率分组求和，再对每组舍入，最后汇总。这一决策会在发票重开、部分退款、折扣分摊时反复被检验：退款须按原行项目的舍入结果逐行冲销，才能保证冲销后仍然闭合。</p>\n<p>第二条是<strong>含税价与不含税价的显示惯例</strong>：欧盟对消费者（B2C）通常要求显示含 VAT 的终价，美国习惯显示不含税货价再加税。同一个后端模型要同时支持两种呈现，模型内部应以<strong>不含税净额 + 税额</strong>存储，含税价作为派生视图计算——反之会在多税率购物车里丢失分摊依据。</p>\n<p>第三条是<strong>货币与汇率</strong>。结算币种与税局申报币种不同时，汇率取用时点必须固定并随订单持久化：税局按申报期汇率核销，结算页按实时汇率报价，两者差额是汇兑损益，不能混入税额字段。呈现模型须把&quot;税额（申报币种）&quot;与&quot;税额（展示币种）&quot;作为两个字段，并记录汇率与取得时点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"呈现模型的系统契约\">呈现模型的系统契约</h2><p>把上述约束折成一个可实现的接口，呈现模型需要向客户端承诺四件事。</p>\n<p><strong>报价（quote）是带时效的凭据，不是函数结果。</strong> 落地价在生成时依赖地址、购物车、账户累计状态与汇率，这些输入会在下一次结账时改变。因此税额的返回体必须携带 <code>quote_id</code>、<code>expires_at</code> 与 <code>basis</code>（依据的制度标识，如 IOSS / OSS / 某州销售税 / 英国低值货），客户端据此在过期时重新取价。</p>\n<p><strong>区分&quot;承诺税额&quot;与&quot;估价税额&quot;。</strong> DDP 与 IOSS 路线的税额是承诺值（下单即锁）；DAP 路线的税额只是估价，必须在响应体中以显式字段（如 <code>collection_point: &quot;at_delivery&quot;</code>）标注，并驱动前端渲染&quot;派送时由承运方收取&quot;的提示。把两者混为同一字段是&quot;意外关税&quot;投诉的直接技术成因。</p>\n<p><strong>落地价明细必须可逐项展开。</strong> 前端要把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P, F, I, D, T, B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 中每个非零项单独列示，而非只给总数。这既是合规要求（价格透明规则要求消费者在下单前看到完整税务信息），也让发票与申报能按分项归集。</p>\n<p><strong>结算页与发票、申报共享同一份税额快照。</strong> 结算时落库的税额快照（税基、税率、税率栈、制度依据、舍入结果、汇率）就是后续开票与申报的唯一真相源。呈现层若在展示时重新计算，就会出现&quot;页面显示 €11.21、发票打印 €11.20&quot;这类无法向税局解释的差异。工程上应把快照生成放在判定引擎内，呈现只是一次读取——判定与呈现分离，快照是唯一的桥。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>结算页的落地价呈现，本质是把&quot;制度判定 → 税率解析 → 税基计算 → 舍入闭合 → 分项展示&quot;链路上的中间结果，以带时效、带依据、与开票口径一致的快照交付给客户端。三类呈现时机决定税负与风险归属，含关税的税基叠加决定真实到手价，地址解析与舍入闭合决定数字的可核验性。任一处偷懒，都会在派送、退款或申报时以&quot;金额对不上&quot;的形式暴露。税额快照如何进入发票与账簿、申报期如何与之对账，是本章后续文档的主题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"结算页税额与落地价（landed cost）呈现模型","id":"结算页税额与落地价-landed-cost-呈现模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：落地价的组成与税基","id":"核心概念-落地价的组成与税基"},{"level":2,"text":"三类呈现时机：估价、DDP 预付与派送时征收","id":"三类呈现时机-估价-ddp-预付与派送时征收"},{"level":2,"text":"税率解析：从送达地地址到税率栈","id":"税率解析-从送达地地址到税率栈"},{"level":2,"text":"精度、舍入与货币：可见数字背后的硬约束","id":"精度-舍入与货币-可见数字背后的硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"呈现模型的系统契约","id":"呈现模型的系统契约"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"判定引擎的时效性、例外路由与税率漂移处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/tax-determination-engine/engine-latency-exception-drift"},"next":{"title":"逐行税额计算、税基拆分与运费折扣分摊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/checkout-collection-invoice-record/line-level-tax-base-apportionment"}}